<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Tracks & Trade — 玩法设计</title>
<style>
:root{--paper:#f4efe3;--ink:#17212b;--muted:#62707b;--green:#577b45;--green2:#86a966;--sea:#8ac4d6;--gold:#d9a33c;--brick:#b85d44;--blue:#3a6ea5;--line:#d7cfbe;--panel:#fffaf0;--shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(45,38,28,.10)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(244,239,227,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,33,43,.08)}
.navin{height:66px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2px}
.logo{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--green);display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.logo svg{width:23px;height:23px}
.links{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:14px;color:#42505c}
.hero{padding:70px 0 44px}
.kicker{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)}
h1{font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:clamp(40px,5.4vw,66px);line-height:1.04;margin:12px 0 20px;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:900px}
.lede{font-size:19px;color:#46525c;max-width:760px}
.thesis{margin-top:26px;padding:18px 20px;border-left:5px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(255,250,240,.72);border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;max-width:860px}
section{padding:56px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(23,33,43,.08)}
.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)}
h2{font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:36px;margin:8px 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 8px}
.purpose{display:inline-block;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b4a22;background:#f3ecdb;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 12px;margin:2px 0 22px;font-weight:650}
.purpose b{color:#8a6a2a;font-weight:800;margin-right:6px}
.section-intro{font-size:17px;color:#58646e;max-width:780px;margin:0 0 26px}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;background:#eee7d8;border-radius:7px;padding:2px 7px;white-space:nowrap}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px}
.card p{font-size:14px;color:#62707b;margin:6px 0 0}
.card.dim{background:#efe9db}
.note{font-size:13.5px;color:#6b757e;margin-top:14px}
/* toc */
.toc{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:10px 24px;margin-top:30px;max-width:860px}
.toc a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30px 150px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;padding:11px 0;border-top:1px dashed #d9cfbb;font-size:14.5px}
.toc a:first-child{border-top:0}
.toc .n{font-weight:900;color:#8a6a2a;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}
.toc .t{font-weight:800}
.toc .q{color:#62707b;font-size:13.5px}
/* lineage */
.lineage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.lcard{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:22px 24px}
.lcard .src{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a2a;margin-bottom:6px}
.lcard h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:14px}
.lcard .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 1fr;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#46525c;align-items:start}
.lcard .row b{color:var(--ink)}
.lcard .yes{color:var(--green);font-weight:900}.lcard .no{color:var(--brick);font-weight:900}
/* pillars */
.pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px}
.pillar{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.pillar .num{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px}
.pillar h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.3}
.pillar p{font-size:13.5px;color:#62707b;margin:0}
.pillar .from{margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a6a2a}
/* story */
.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px}
.story .card h3{font-size:16px}
.story .card .big{font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.1}
.chart{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:18px 18px 8px}
.chart svg{width:100%;display:block}
.legend{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:#56616a;padding:6px 6px 8px}
.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.legend i{display:inline-block;width:22px;height:0;border-top:2px solid}
.aside{margin-top:18px;background:#17212b;color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:20px 24px}
.aside summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:#fbe7b6;list-style:none}
.aside summary:before{content:'▸ ';}
.aside[open] summary:before{content:'▾ ';}
.aside .f{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#fbe7b6;margin-top:12px}
.aside .f b{color:#fff}
.aside p{font-size:13.5px;color:#aeb9c2;margin:10px 0 0}
/* map */
.map-demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:18px;align-items:stretch}
.map-card{background:#eef2e2;border:1px solid rgba(23,33,43,.12);border-radius:22px;padding:10px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.map-card svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.legend-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:22px 24px}
.legend-card h3{margin-top:0}
.legend-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin:12px 0;font-size:14px}
.legend-item .sw{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:5px;margin-top:3px;flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
/* loop */
.loop{background:#17212b;color:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:26px 28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);margin-bottom:18px}
.loop-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.loop-step{position:relative;background:#222f3a;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;min-height:120px}
.loop-step b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px}
.loop-step span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#aeb9c2}
.loop-step:after{content:'→';position:absolute;right:-18px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#d9a33c;font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
.loop-step:last-child:after{display:none}
.decisions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.decision{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px}
.decision .key{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#eee7d8;color:#6b5a30;margin-bottom:10px}
.decision h3{font-size:18px}
.decision p{font-size:14px;color:#62707b;margin:0 0 8px}
.decision .ex{font-size:13px;color:#5b4a22;background:#f3ecdb;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;margin-top:10px}
/* unlocks */
.unlock-wrap{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:10px 24px}
.unlock{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px 170px 1fr;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px dashed #d9cfbb;font-size:14px;align-items:start}
.unlock:first-child{border-top:0}
.unlock .t{font-weight:900;color:#8a6a2a;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}
.unlock .what b{display:block}
.unlock .what span{font-size:12.5px;color:#62707b}
.unlock .why{font-size:13.5px;color:#46525c}
.unlock .why em{font-style:normal;font-weight:750;color:var(--ink)}
/* scope */
.scope{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.scope .item{background:#fdf8ed;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;gap:10px;font-size:14px}
.scope .item .x{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brick);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.scope .item b{display:block;margin-bottom:3px}
.scope .item span{color:#62707b;font-size:13.5px}
/* appendix */
.appendix{background:#efe9db;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:6px 24px}
.appendix details{border-top:1px dashed #d9cfbb;padding:14px 0}
.appendix details:first-child{border-top:0}
.appendix summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;list-style:none}
.appendix summary:before{content:'▸ ';color:#8a6a2a}
.appendix details[open] summary:before{content:'▾ '}
.appendix summary small{font-weight:500;color:#62707b;margin-left:8px;font-size:13px}
.appendix .body{margin-top:14px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;font-size:13.5px}
th,td{padding:10px 13px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-top:1px solid #e8e0cf}
th{background:#eee7d8;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5d6871;border-top:0}
td b{font-weight:800}
.tblwrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:16px}
.tickrule{display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;font-size:14px}
.tickrule .n{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--gold);color:#17212b;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:13px}
.tickrule b{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.tickrule span{font-size:13.5px;color:#56616a}
.wire{background:#e9e2d3;border:1px solid rgba(23,33,43,.12);border-radius:18px;padding:12px}
.wire svg{width:100%;display:block}
footer{padding:38px 0 52px;color:#6d777f;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:900px){.lineage,.map-demo,.two,.scope{grid-template-columns:1fr}.three,.story,.decisions{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.loop-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.loop-step:after{content:'↓';right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-26px;transform:translateX(-50%)}.unlock{grid-template-columns:70px 1fr}.unlock .why{grid-column:2}.toc a{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr}.toc .q{grid-column:2}.links{display:none}}
@media(max-width:560px){.wrap{padding:0 16px}.hero{padding-top:44px}.three,.story,.decisions,.pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2{font-size:30px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.cargo{animation:move 3.2s linear infinite alternate}@keyframes move{0%{offset-distance:0%}100%{offset-distance:100%}}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><div class="wrap navin"><div class="brand"><span class="logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 17c3-5 6-8 8-12 2 4 5 7 8 12H4Z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M12 5v14" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span>Tracks &amp; Trade</div><div class="links"><a href="#lineage">血统</a><a href="#principles">原则</a><a href="#tension">核心张力</a><a href="#space">空间</a><a href="#player">玩家</a><a href="#hour">第一小时</a><a href="#scope">边界</a><a href="#appendix">附录</a></div></div></nav>

<header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<div class="kicker">Game design · idle logistics</div>
<h1>价格永远比你快半步。</h1>
<p class="lede">一个可以一直玩下去的单人物流 idle 游戏。经济来自 Cookie Clicker：产出线性增长，价格指数增长，只有升级能追上。空间来自 Roads &amp; Boats：原木长在林子里，得有人把它运回来，而路有多远决定了一切值多少钱。</p>
<div class="thesis">设计要回答的唯一问题：当挂机永远追不上价格时，玩家靠什么追上？答案是「换一种运输方式」——每一次升级都改变地图的形状，而不是给数字加百分比。</div>

<div class="toc">
<a href="#lineage"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">两个游戏各借一半</span><span class="q">这个游戏是什么、不是什么</span></a>
<a href="#principles"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">五条设计原则</span><span class="q">所有规则都从这五条推出来</span></a>
<a href="#tension"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">核心张力</span><span class="q">为什么挂机追不上，升级追得上</span></a>
<a href="#space"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">为什么要有地图</span><span class="q">空间怎么把「买什么」变成「在哪买」</span></a>
<a href="#player"><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">玩家在做什么</span><span class="q">循环、三种决策、注意力的节奏</span></a>
<a href="#hour"><span class="n">06</span><span class="t">第一个小时</span><span class="q">新机制出现的节奏，以及为什么不结束</span></a>
<a href="#scope"><span class="n">07</span><span class="t">刻意不做的</span><span class="q">每一项都写了为什么</span></a>
<a href="#appendix"><span class="n">附</span><span class="t">数值与规则</span><span class="q">实现细节，折叠，按需看</span></a>
</div>
</div></header>

<!-- ================= 01 LINEAGE ================= -->
<section id="lineage"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">01 · Lineage</div>
<h2>两个游戏各借一半</h2>
<div class="purpose"><b>这一节回答</b>这个游戏是什么、不是什么。读完应该能一句话向别人转述。</div>
<p class="section-intro">Cookie Clicker 有最纯粹的「数字往上走」经济，但没有空间。Roads &amp; Boats 有最纯粹的「东西在哪就是在哪」空间，但是回合制、多人、有结束。各取一半，扔掉另一半。</p>
<div class="lineage">
<div class="lcard"><div class="src">From Cookie Clicker</div><h3>经济</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>一种货币，一个大数字。</b>木板就是饼干。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>同一种东西越买越贵。</b>第 n 件 = 底价 × 1.15ⁿ。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>升级是乘数，只买一次，贵得离谱。</b></div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>没有结束，没有失败。</b>走开永远安全。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="no">×</span><div><b>不借金饼干。</b>随机事件留给以后。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="no">×</span><div><b>不借飞升。</b>第一小时用不上。</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lcard"><div class="src">From Roads &amp; Boats</div><h3>空间</h3>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>六边形地图，地形就是规则。</b>河不能走，山要绕。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>原料是局部的。</b>林子里的木头，没运回来就不存在。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>运输工具是要花产出去买的。</b>要搬更多，先把产出花在搬运上。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="yes">✓</span><div><b>升级改变连通方式。</b>船、桥、铁路，不是 +20%。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="no">×</span><div><b>不借多人和公共建筑。</b>单人。</div></div>
<div class="row"><span class="no">×</span><div><b>不借奇迹和终局。</b>没有得分。</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= 02 PRINCIPLES ================= -->
<section id="principles"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">02 · Principles</div>
<h2>五条设计原则</h2>
<div class="purpose"><b>这一节回答</b>规则是从哪里推出来的。后面每个机制都能指回这里的某一条。</div>
<div class="pillars">
<div class="pillar"><div class="num">1</div><h3>引擎线性，价格指数</h3><p>多买一件同类，产出 +1 份，价格 ×1.15。纯靠等，攒下一件的时间越来越长。这是游戏的地基。</p><div class="from">Cookie Clicker</div></div>
<div class="pillar"><div class="num">2</div><h3>升级是新原语，不是加成</h3><p>追上价格的唯一方式是乘数。每个乘数都是一种新的运输 / 加工方式，让玩家重新看一遍地图。</p><div class="from">两者都有</div></div>
<div class="pillar"><div class="num">3</div><h3>产出是瓶颈，不是加总</h3><p>木板/秒 = 伐木、运力、锯木三条阶梯的最小值。买错阶梯，数字一点不涨。地图告诉你是哪条。</p><div class="from">Roads &amp; Boats</div></div>
<div class="pillar"><div class="num">4</div><h3>距离就是价格</h3><p>远处的林子更富，但一头驴来回要更久。同一头驴在 d=3 只有 d=1 的三分之一。没有路和车，富矿等于不存在。</p><div class="from">Roads &amp; Boats</div></div>
<div class="pillar"><div class="num">5</div><h3>没有失败，只有浪费</h3><p>仓满就停，不坏不烧。离开永远安全，但每一秒的浪费都画在地图上。这是 idle 的良心。</p><div class="from">Idle 类型</div></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<!-- ================= 03 TENSION ================= -->
<section id="tension"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">03 · Core tension</div>
<h2>挂机追不上，升级追得上</h2>
<div class="purpose"><b>这一节回答</b>为什么这个经济会一直让人想再玩五分钟。</div>
<p class="section-intro">把「下一件东西的价格」和「引擎每分钟的产出」画在同一张对数图上，整个游戏的形状就出来了。</p>
<div class="story">
<div class="card"><div class="big">1</div><h3>先是引擎领先</h3><p>开局东西便宜，买一件涨一份，攒下一件很快。前七八分钟像所有 idle 游戏一样爽。</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="big">2</div><h3>然后价格反超</h3><p>价格是指数，引擎是线性。第 10 头驴要 32 木板，第 20 头要 130。攒钱的时间从几秒变成几分钟。玩家第一次感到「卡住了」。</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="big">3</div><h3>升级把引擎抛回去</h3><p>马车让所有驴载量翻倍——相当于白送你现在所有的驴。曲线垂直跳一格，重新领先。然后价格再追，下一个升级更贵。如此往复。</p></div>
</div>
<div class="chart">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 340" role="img" aria-label="价格增长与引擎增长对比示意图" font-family="inherit">
<line x1="64" y1="296.0" x2="740" y2="296.0" stroke="#e3dccb" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="54" y="300.0" font-size="11" fill="#7a848c" text-anchor="end">1</text>
<line x1="64" y1="250.3" x2="740" y2="250.3" stroke="#e3dccb" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="54" y="254.3" font-size="11" fill="#7a848c" text-anchor="end">10</text>
<line x1="64" y1="204.7" x2="740" y2="204.7" stroke="#e3dccb" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="54" y="208.7" font-size="11" fill="#7a848c" text-anchor="end">100</text>
<line x1="64" y1="159.0" x2="740" y2="159.0" stroke="#e3dccb" stroke-width="1"/>
<text x="54" y="163.0" font-size="11" fill="#7a848c" text-anchor="end">1k</text>
